  "track.kotlin.m.eval.co.double.result": "Double follows the IEEE 754 binary floating-point standard, so many decimals such as 0.1 cannot be represented exactly. For money, use integers in the smallest unit (cents) or BigDecimal. [[src:kt-numbers]]",
